sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Cliente
    participant API as "erp-api<br/>CommandOrderControllerV1"
    participant App as "erp-application<br/>CreateOrderUseCase / UpdateOrderStatusUseCase / CancelOrderUseCase"
    participant Domain as "erp-domain<br/>OrderRoot / OrderFactory"
    participant Infra as "erp-infrastructure<br/>OrderRepository"
    participant Common as "erp-common<br/>DTOs / Commands"

    Note over API,App: Crear orden (POST)
    Client->>API: POST /commands/orders { CreateOrderCommand }
    API->>Common: validar/request mapping
    API->>App: CreateOrderUseCase.execute(CreateOrderCommand)
    App->>Domain: OrderFactory.create(...) -> OrderAggregate<br/>OrderRoot.create(orderNumber, customer, items -> List<OrderItem>)
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(OrderAggregate / OrderRoot)
    Infra-->>Domain: persisted Order id
    Domain-->>App: OrderAggregate (con id)
    App-->>API: retorna id
    API-->>Client: 201 Created Location: /commands/orders/{id}

    Note over API,App: Cancelar orden (PATCH /{id}/cancel)
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/cancel?reason=...
    API->>App: CancelOrderUseCase.execute(CancelOrderCommand)
    App->>Infra: OrderRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: OrderRoot
    App->>Domain: OrderRoot.cancel(reason)
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(OrderRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content

    Note over API,App: Actualizar estado (PATCH /{id}/status)
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/status?status=SHIPPED
    API->>App: UpdateOrderStatusUseCase.execute(UpdateOrderStatusCommand)
    App->>Infra: OrderRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: OrderRoot
    App->>Domain: OrderRoot.updateStatus(newStatus)
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(OrderRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content
